+| Fajl | Promjena |
+|---|---|
+| `backend/src/common/database/database-pool.constants.ts` | Nove: imena role (`api`/`worker`), defaulti i granice (`DB_POOL_MAX` 1–200, `DB_POOL_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS` 100–600000, `DB_POOL_CONNECTION_TIMEOUT_MS`, `DB_STATEMENT_TIMEOUT_MS`), `application_name` prefiksi |
